Subject: [PATCH] Left dock rebuilt from the live-app recording

- leftdock.js/css: docked Main / Color / Tool panels on the measured grid,
  shape groups with menus (labels from english.tvpaint.loc), per-tool option
  forms (pen, pencil, air, custom, text, bucket, filling shape, cut, select, crop)
